<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates narrow to 4.00-4.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates narrow to 4.00-4.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar narrowed on Tuesday to 4.00-4.50 percent from a wider 3.00 to 5.00 percent band on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said persistent excess dinar liquidity within the banking sector is still putting downward pressure on rates.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
